{"id":"vod_sn_35863","vodId":"35863","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"别撒娇了！喝！","name_cn":"别撒娇了！喝！","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/8c0a864a9963240088a05a4609608ef2.jpg"},"summary":"《极乐天师第二季无修版》动漫全集又名《不要撒娇哦无删减》,是一部剧情与画风俱佳的日本后宫动漫。讲述了正在进行见习僧侣修行中的里中逸刚，“为了成为一个合格的僧侣”，去到他的祖母净德做主持的赛円寺修行。在那里等待着逸刚的是严厉的修行、怪异的除妖家业、以及……6个年轻的尼姑。整天被年龄相似的尼姑们包围着的逸刚，看似过着极乐般的生活，但实际上却是被那些个性恶劣的尼姑们呼来唤去。更凄惨的是，在见习修行的术方面也完全不是尼姑们的对手。然而，这样无能的逸刚，在某个特定条件下就会觉醒压倒性的法力...那就是……看到诱人的女性裸体的情况下……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:38:18","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Gw5H1SSqh91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gHhn4KGaNJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/23y3w1WcYi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NBbeBeWtxY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pvAVXvZNrz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0ESZJdUTdt1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PAe9YZLtfB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3DZdSwAaZ71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Fum40e45AK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jb5pBJv50b1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tMWtHQ6qrv1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/td60d8v0ZA1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:29.888Z"}